@startuml breadknife-control-reload
participant 调用方
participant "bread 客户端" as cli
participant "bread daemon" as daemon
participant "窗口进程" as win

调用方 -> cli: bread open-all / close / reload / exit
cli -> daemon: bread.sock 行协议指令
alt reload
  daemon -> win: reload（按跟踪的 CSS 路径重读）
  win --> daemon: 生效
else open / close / toggle / exit
  daemon -> win: spawn / 终止 / 可见性切换
end
@enduml
